{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach it. If approached, take object and check its properties. Finally, move to location. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = MoveToLocation    />\"",
